&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zq66iz87z2z69ztz70zz67zz69zz78zejz77zz90zoae3z78zexz90zmz78zj2c&quot;&gt;Dropbox is looking for an APJ Communications Lead based in Australia or Japan to strengthen our reputation and support business priorities across Australia, Japan, South Korea, Singapore, and India. You’ll shape how customers, media, and industry leaders understand Dropbox as we expand beyond file storage into AI-powered work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;You’ll partner with regional leaders and global communications, marketing, and product teams to connect Dropbox’s global story to local priorities through product and customer storytelling, media relations, executive visibility, and reputation management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone who can lead communications strategy and manage day-to-day execution, from advising executives and developing campaigns to writing briefings and pitching journalists. You’ll bring strong editorial judgement, regional expertise, and the ability to turn complex ideas into clear, relevant stories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Own and execute Dropbox’s APJ communications strategy, aligning regional programmes with business priorities and global communications objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Lead regional product announcements and launches, adapting global narratives to reflect local customer needs, market conditions, and cultural context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Build and maintain relationships with business and technology journalists, influential voices, and relevant industry stakeholders across priority markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Partner with customer, sales, and marketing teams to identify compelling customer stories and bring their perspectives into communications programmes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Advise regional leaders on external communications, prepare them for media and speaking engagements, and partner with global communications on issues that could affect Dropbox’s reputation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Lead agency partners across APJ, setting clear priorities, managing budgets, and ensuring consistent, high-quality execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Bring regional insights into global planning, measure results against communications objectives, and use those findings to refine priorities and resource allocation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;10+ years of relevant communications experience, including responsibility for programmes across multiple APJ markets including Australia, Japan, South Korea, Singapore and India.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Excellent writing and editing skills with the ability to make complex business and technology topics accessible and engaging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;A track record of developing communications strategies and delivering measurable results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;A strong understanding of the region’s media landscape, business environment, and cultural differences, with established relationships in key markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Experience advising senior executives and preparing them for external engagements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Sound judgement and experience managing corporate issues and reputational risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Ability to influence and collaborate across functions, markets, and time zones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Experience managing agency partners and budgets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Proficiency in an additional language relevant to the region, particularly Japanese or Korean highly regarded.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z956n2dz76zz86zez67zz65zz76z7wz77zz71zz87z2vz66zz77z06dz78zz75zz84z9z66zz68zv&quot;&gt;Experience developing earned and owned content, with a strong understanding of how they work together within the broader communications mix.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z7z65z9wz73z7z75z6emz81zz70z4oz65zrz86z4dnz72ztz67zvoz67zl91&quot;&gt;Durable Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;AI fluency means using these tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;amplify&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; human judgment, not replace it. We believe people with these skills will thrive as work and technology&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;continue to evolve:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;nderstand &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; and others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;valuat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; information and mak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;decisions in complex situations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;earn, adjust, and stay effective through change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connection:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;ommunicat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;, collaborat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;, and build trust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;To learn more about why these skills matter and what the data shows about thriving through change, read this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot;&gt;blog post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt; our Chief People Officer, Melanie Rosenwasser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Role Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Product Security Engineering team, you’ll focus on reducing risk at scale by building the security infrastructure, automation, and tooling that empowers engineers to ship secure products with confidence. We work closely with engineering and product teams throughout the software development lifecycle (SDLC), embedding secure-by-default practices and delivering scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Security Engineers create impact by implementing security tooling, writing custom security rules, and building frameworks that address broad classes of vulnerabilities. In addition to proactive development, we support teams through threat modeling, documentation, and education to uplift security culture across Dropbox.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95lz89zy6z71zz79zz84zz68zyz69zupz72zz79zcz69zz76zkz79zp1z66ztz67zxz71zz89zz86zz71z&quot;&gt;Our Engineering Career Framework is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95lz89zy6z71zz79zz84zz68zyz69zupz72zz79zcz69zz76zkz79zp1z66ztz67zxz71zz89zz86zz71z&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://dropbox.github.io/dbx-career-framework/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://dropbox.github.io/dbx-career-framework/&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;viewable by anyone outside the company&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95lz89zy6z71zz79zz84zz68zyz69zupz72zz79zcz69zz76zkz79zp1z66ztz67zxz71zz89zz86zz71z&quot;&gt; and describes what’s expected for our engineers at each of our career levels. Check out our blog post on this topic and more &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95lz89zy6z71zz79zz84zz68zyz69zupz72zz79zcz69zz76zkz79zp1z66ztz67zxz71zz89zz86zz71z&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://dropbox.tech/culture/sharing-our-engineering-career-framework-with-the-world&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://dropbox.tech/culture/sharing-our-engineering-career-framework-with-the-world&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95lz89zy6z71zz79zz84zz68zyz69zupz72zz79zcz69zz76zkz79zp1z66ztz67zxz71zz89zz86zz71z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain security tools, automation, and libraries to enable secure-by-default development across engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement custom security rules &lt;span class=&quot; h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt; Semgrep, CodeQL) to detect and prevent common and emerging vulnerability patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert on application security across web, mobile, and desktop environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and scale the Secure Development Lifecycle &lt;span class=&quot; h-lparen&quot;&gt;(SDLC)&lt;/span&gt; by integrating tools, checks, and processes into engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform targeted code reviews, and develop follow-up tooling or controls to prevent regressions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with engineering, product, GRC, and AI/ML teams to proactively address security risks, especially in fast-moving and emerging tech areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
